OL,3,GNEWSATeenage biker suffered severe
OL,4,Ainjuries in cliffside beauty spot crash
OL,5,A- inquest
OL,6,
OL,7,FA teenage motorcyclist who died after
OL,8,Ffalling into the sea off the Great Orme
OL,9,Fsuffered severe head, chest and
OL,10,Fabdominal injuries, an inquest has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FFilip Szwarnog-Stepien, 19, of Bodnant
OL,14,FRoad, Llandudno, died following a crash
OL,15,Fon 29 October.
OL,17,FHe was recovered from the water and
OL,18,Ftaken to Ysbyty Gwynedd in Bangor,
OL,19,FGwynedd, where his death was confirmed
OL,20,Fin the early hours of the following
OL,21,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
